# The repository stores LF, and so does the checkout.
#
# This is not cosmetics: `tools/gen_socdb.py` hashes header bytes, the evidence
# contract quotes file offsets, and the CI job that regenerates `verification/*.md`
# diffs them against the committed documents.  All three would depend on the
# line-ending preference of whoever cloned the repo if git were allowed to convert.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.typed text eol=lf
*.cfg   text eol=lf

# Nothing binary is supposed to be here (firmware images are fetched on demand and
# gitignored), but a stray one must never be line-ending "fixed".
*.bin   binary
*.elf   binary
*.hex   binary
*.png   binary
*.gz    binary
